			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "SENSOR BUSES - 3.3V LOGIC ONLY\nJ9 I2C: 1 3V3 | 2 SDA | 3 SCL | 4 GND\nBME280: SDA GPIO41 / SCL GPIO42.\nJP1 SDA / JP11 SCL: fit for extra 4k7\npull-ups; check total bus pull-up load.\nJ10 1-Wire: 1 GND | 2 3V3 | 3 DQ\nDS18B20 DQ GPIO5; powered 3-wire bus.\n3V3 sensor rail: F3 PTC 0.25A nominal;\n1-Wire branch F4 PTC 0.10A nominal.\nPTC ratings derate with temperature."
		(at 65.895953 67.491948 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "1837a03a-2dc8-43c5-9f54-a94b8f288916")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "VE.DIRECT / POWER + ISOLATION\nV+ from Victron powers isolated side.\nUse original cable / verify pin numbers.\nDo NOT bridge ISO GND to board GND.\nNo RS232 +/-voltage or RS485 interface."
		(at 66.295953 77.77206 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "ef8cee98-31d7-488a-a15e-de4827f85098")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "LIMITS / CONTINUED\nFuse rating is NOT allowed load current!\nThermal test; NO continuous 2A guarantee.\n100x100mm; M3 centres 92x92mm.\nWashers/standoffs <=7mm OD; mind underside."
		(at 69.93405 123.27206 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "ec2c3fe8-44d3-4531-9e73-1d27a41c1bc8")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "UV / J17 / JP10 - GPIO3 ADC1\nJ17: 1 GND | 2 SIGNAL | 3 3V3 | 4 5V\nPower sensor from ONE supply pin only.\nJP10 1-2: input 0-3.3V; scale 1.1\nJP10 2-3: input 0-5V; scale 1.66534\nSelect range BEFORE applying signal.\n5V range: 5V input -> 3.0024V ADC.\nSensor volts != UVI: calibrate sensor.\nTVS + 10k + rail clamps + RC filter."
		(at 75.015003 106.847971 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "f415a938-aee5-49ad-bc20-6317e0e5be00")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "FIRST POWER-UP / HARDWARE\nHeltec WiFi LoRa 32 V3/V3.1/V3.2;\nUSB end at USB-C mark; align sockets.\nRemove module; current-limit supply.\nSelect JP8; verify TP3=5V, no shorts."
		(at 75.476906 116.27206 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "545ae069-de2f-4692-943c-8736428bfb3a")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "POWER / CONTINUED\nUSB only: remove shunt; disconnect VIN\nNo external 5V terminal input.\nNo auto-mux / no reverse-current isolation.\nPower OFF + discharge before rewiring.\nUSB does not power VIN / heater loads."
		(at 90.653097 94.416038 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "ce9dec0f-6c75-4d6c-b83d-d25912c7ebb5")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "AUX / J11 - ANALOG + PULSE\nPins: 1 3V3 | 2 AIN | 3 PULSE | 4 GND\nAIN GPIO4 ADC1; R24 series = 10k.\nR25 absent: scale 1; input <=3.3V\n(useful ADC range about 0-3.1V).\nFit R25 15k for 0-5V; scale 1.66667\n(downlink x1000 = 1667; 5V -> 3V ADC).\nPULSE GPIO48: reed / open collector;\npull-up + RC + inverting Schmitt.\nNever connect battery / 12V to AUX."
		(at 92.700715 67.491948 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "b17d87c8-4e02-4cea-a8cd-00843cc74b53")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "POWER / JP8 - ONE SOURCE ONLY\nJ3: 1 VIN 6-29.2V | 2 GND\nJ18 DC jack: center +, <=24V; not with J3\nJP8 fitted: VIN buck -> 5V rail\nJP8: REMOVE BEFORE USB"
		(at 93.505477 77.77206 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "fc06b140-e7e0-4c1e-94ad-ea8036471332")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "FIRST POWER-UP / CONTINUED\nPower OFF; fit module; check TP4=3.3V.\nGPIO20 ID about 1.65V -> PCB v2.0.\nEnable/configure optional I/O in FW.\nNo powered sensor signals with MCU OFF."
		(at 98.529287 123.27206 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "6284c6de-78ef-4bf1-9f97-c50896efa5e6")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "ISOLATED VE.DIRECT / J14 + J15\nBoth: 1 ISO GND | 2 TX | 3 RX | 4 V+\nTX = node -> Victron RX (GPIO34)\nRX = Victron TX -> node (GPIO33)"
		(at 98.995954 129.628083 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "30b0460b-4d82-4f39-beef-123a3054b57b")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "TEST POINTS / CONTINUED\nJ16 signals: 3.3V, not field protected.\nTP1/TP5 GND | TP2 protected VIN\nTP3 5V | TP4 3V3 | TP6 3V3H | TP7 OW\nADC probe pads: C17 AUX / C27 UV."
		(at 103.376907 116.27206 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "ea83ca11-9150-4709-9637-0770fa809bf2")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "PROTECTION / MECHANICAL LIMITS\nVIN: Q7 MOSFET reverse protection.\nUSB current shares Heltec power path.\nNOT a lightning / surge approval.\nD1 MUST be bidirectional SMBJ30CA.\nF7 6.3A main / F5 4A heater fuse."
		(at 106.057858 108.416038 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "a187f7ba-6728-4032-880e-6ddceb095fa0")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "DAVIS WIND / RAIN\nJ5 WIND: 1 GND | 2 SPD | 3 DIR | 4 3V3\nJ4 RJ11: 2 3V3 | 3 DIR | 4 GND | 5 SPD\nRJ11 contacts 1/6 unused; use pin nos.\nJ7 RAIN: 1 GND | 2 RAIN\nJ6 RJ11: 3 RAIN | 4 GND; 1/2/5/6 NC\nRJ11 + screw terminal are parallel.\nJP2 OPEN: Davis potentiometer vane.\nJP2 FITTED: extra 4k7 vane pull-up.\nSpeed GPIO6 / rain GPIO7 / dir GPIO2."
		(at 118.776907 89.491948 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "db0d65ff-37f3-46a9-97d9-b0c84056f185")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "HEATER / FAN - CHECK LOAD RATINGS\nJ12: 1 +V = protected VIN | 2 HEAT-\nHeater <=3A; low-side PWM (GPIO38).\nHEAT- is switched, NOT permanent GND.\nJ13: 1 FAN+ | 2 GND | 3 TACH\nFan: high-side PWM (GPIO39).\nJP9 1-2: 5V, <=0.5A (default)\nJP9 2-3: protected VIN, <=1A\nUse a fan rated for selected voltage.\nCombined 5V loads share source budget.\nJP12 fit: OC tacho; off: ext. pull-up."
		(at 119.224527 60.135926 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "eba3b80f-ee38-4782-8941-525be0200d98")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.13)
			)
			(justify mirror)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "UNIVERSAL WEATHER NODE v2.0 / franzenhof.com / CERN-OHL-P v2"
		(at 120.005478 51.69615 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
		(uuid "afdf0210-2359-427e-8a2e-da4e343b7285")
		(effects
			(font
