	(gr_text "SENSOR BUSES - 3.3V LOGIC ONLY\nJ9 I2C: 1 3V3 | 2 SDA | 3 SCL | 4 GND\nBME280: SDA GPIO41 / SCL GPIO42.\nJP1 SDA / JP11 SCL: fit for extra 4k7\npull-ups; check total bus pull-up load.\nJ10 1-Wire: 1 GND | 2 3V3 | 3 DQ\nDS18B20 DQ GPIO5; powered 3-wire bus.\n3V3 sensors: own LDO U7, F3 PTC 0.25A;\n1-Wire branch F4 PTC 0.10A nominal.\nPTC ratings derate with temperature."
		(at 120.395953 75.991948 0)
		(layer "B.SilkS")
