	(gr_text "EXPANSION / TEST POINTS\nJ16 DNP: 1 GND | 2 3V3 | 3 SDA\n4 SCL | 5 GPIO19 | 6 5V\nGPIO19 also controls vane supply:\nLOW = vane ON; not a free output."
